      "title": "dfilter: fix memory leaks in translation registry",
      "message": "dfilter: fix memory leaks in translation registry\n\nThis fixes two memory leaks in the dfilter translator code. The first is\nthe name of the translator that is duplicated on registration and must\nbe freed on deregistration. The second is an intermediate GList that\nleaks once for each call to get_dfilter_translator_list.\n",
